f Calla or Eris, tackling unique challenges and puzzles on your own in a beautifully crafted single-player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/7630a960c4ed4366e6aa5be89625a131.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/976671affd2d29edff2cb2c3d51165fe.poster.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/976671affd2d29edff2cb2c3d51165fe.webm?t=1750504650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Take on the hero's quest to find and save the lost sheep of your village, each uniquely adorable and awaiting rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/51ec3a498cae59fa9e86899cf6012a4a.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/ffaff6e1c760f7f3e79b210100d46384.poster.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/ffaff6e1c760f7f3e79b210100d46384.webm?t=1750504650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Strategically navigate through fiery landscapes, using tools and clever thinking to manage and extinguish flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"